    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know about the numbers but it doesn't change the reality. the bank doesn't care about a hotline. they're taking everything. i've worked my whole life just to end up in this hole. the shame of it is just... it's too much to live with. i feel like i'm just a burden to everyone now.",
